mpanion":"ilse","approval_at_least":40}],"expression":2,"text":"The fire is laid the way she lays it — small, hot, and screened on the uphill side — and she has left the good stone on your side of it. \\"Sit down,\\" Ilse says. \\"The ground is watched. I did that first so that we could stop thinking about it.\\"","choices":[{"label":"How do you read a hillside?","conditions":[{"not":{"flag":"camp_ilse_ground"}}],"next":"camp_ilse_ground"},{"label":"Four pounds of salt, every fortnight.","conditions":[{"not":{"flag":"camp_ilse_salt"}}],"next":"camp_ilse_salt"},{"label":"How did you come by this hill?","conditions":[{"companion":"ilse","approval_at_least":15},{"not":{"flag":"camp_ilse_eleven_years"}}],"next":"camp_ilse_eleven_years"},{"label":"What did the first winter look like, from up here?","conditions":[{"companion":"ilse","approval_at_least":40},{"not":{"flag":"camp_ilse_first_winter"}}],"next":"camp_ilse_first_winter"},{"label":"Where do you keep the book?","conditions":[{"flag":"deep_known"},{"not":{"flag":"camp_ilse_the_book"}}],"next":"camp_ilse_the_book"},{"label":"Reed wants a warden''s word on the raids.","conditions":[{"quest":"teeth_in_the_hills","stage":"find_the_warden"}],"next":"camp_ilse_the_road"},{"label":"The shaft. Do you sleep, since?","conditions":[{"flag":"deep_shaft_fate"},{"not":{"flag":"camp_ilse_fate_told"}}],"next":"camp_ilse_fate"},{"label":"Ground and weather are done. What''s the third thing?","conditions":[{"companion":"ilse","approval_at_least":30},{"not":{"companion":"ilse","romance_stage":2}},{"not":{"companion":"ilse","romance_locked":true}}],"next":"ilse_close"},{"label":"Stay by the fire tonight.","conditions":[{"companion":"ilse","romance_stage":2}],"next":"romance_after"},{"label":"Get some sleep.","end":true},{"label":"You keep two books. What is in the other one?","conditions":[{"flag":"camp_ilse_the_book"},{"companion":"ilse","approval_at_least":15},{"not":{"flag":"ilse_names_known"}}],"next":"camp_ilse_the_names"},{"labe